## Editing the model

| What to change | Where |
|---|---|
| Surveillance cost estimates | [`amua_import_parameters_v4.csv`](../amua_import_parameters_v4.csv): `c_surv_MVP_op`, `c_S1b_op_*` |
| Coordination cost estimates | CSV: `c_C1_NMC_closure_op` … `c_C5_KPI_dashboard_op` |
| Detection probabilities | CSV: `d_status_quo`, `d_surveillance_mvp`, `d_S1b_event_community_*` |
| False-positive rates | CSV: `p_fp_S1b_lo/mid/hi` |
| Cluster multiplier (k) | Inline constants `k_lo`, `k_mid`, `k_hi` at top of setup chunk |
| Chemical agent fractions | CSV (terbufos): `frac_terbufos_attributable_*`; CSV (aldicarb): `frac_aldicarb_attributable_*` |
| Response efficacy η | CSV: `eta_response_lo/mid/hi` |
| RAMP_MONTHS | Inline constant in Scenario 1.5 chunk |
| Age/sex weights | `age_sex_weights` tibble in scaffold chunk (not yet evaluated) |
| DALY parameters | CSV: `yll_mean_age_at_death`, `yll_per_death_gbd`, `yld_*`, `icer_per_daly_gdp` |

